      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Write amplification = bytes written to storage / bytes written by the app.",
      "narration": "Write amplification is physical bytes written divided by logical bytes. LSM compaction rewrites data once per level, so leveled compaction can cost ten or more.",
