      "caption": "LSM wins on write-heavy ingest; B-trees win on reads and predictable latency.",
      "narration": "Choose LSM for heavy ingest and sequential writes. Choose a B-tree for read-heavy workloads and steady tail latency, since compaction causes background spikes.",
